{"seq":1,"slug":"estimate-vs-actual-variance","title":"预估与实际税费差异处理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/landed-cost-ddp-buyer-experience/duty-variance-reconcile/estimate-vs-actual-variance","wordCount":2181,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"预估与实际税费差异处理\">预估与实际税费差异处理</h1><p>一笔 DDP 订单预收了 28.01 欧元税费，实际税单是 33.40 欧元。多出来的 5.39 这一笔该记到谁头上？如果只看单笔，答案是随机的；但如果把上千笔这样的差异聚合起来并做正确归因，答案通常会清晰地分成几组，每一组对应一个可以修的系统缺陷。这一篇要建立的正是这套归因方法——它的产物不是一个差异率，而是一张按原因分类的差异台账，第三章后两篇（处置策略、合规红线）都建立在这张台账之上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>差异有六种来源</strong>，性质互不相同：归类改判、估价重估、运费偏差、汇率偏差、门槛误判、模型近似。混在一起统计只能得到一个无法行动的差异率。</li>\n<li><strong>归因必须按固定顺序判定</strong>，从最外生、最不可控的原因开始排除，否则同一笔差异会被记到多个原因下。</li>\n<li><strong>归类改判用改判率与幅度分位数度量</strong>，不用平均值——它的特点正是幅度跳跃、频率低。</li>\n<li><strong>容差应当双边但不对称</strong>：少收（平台损失）容差略大、多收（买家损失）容差小；且要按市场分层，并用绝对与相对两个条件取「任一超限」。</li>\n<li><strong>落在容差内的差异仍要记录归因</strong>，只是不触发买家侧动作；丢弃它们会系统性低估模型偏差。</li>\n<li><strong>追征与退还都有时限</strong>，差异台账的每一条未处置记录都是一个有到期日的应收或应付权利。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"差异的六种来源\">差异的六种来源</h2><p>把「差异」当成一个整体来统计是这条链路上最常见的分析错误。差异至少来自六个彼此独立的机制，它们的分布形态、可控性和修复路径都不同。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>方向性</th>\n<th>可控性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>归类改判</td>\n<td>海关把 HS 编码改到另一税目</td>\n<td>双向，跳跃</td>\n<td>中：可提高归类质量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>估价重估</td>\n<td>加计运费/保险/特许权使用费，或改用替代方法</td>\n<td>偏低为主</td>\n<td>中：口径对齐后可减</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运费偏差</td>\n<td>预估运费与出运实运费不同</td>\n<td>双向，小</td>\n<td>高：接入实运费</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>汇率偏差</td>\n<td>申报月汇率与下单时冻结汇率不同</td>\n<td>双向，小</td>\n<td>高：统一汇率时点</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>门槛误判</td>\n<td>判定粒度或内在价值取数错误</td>\n<td>双向，量级大</td>\n<td>高：修正判定模块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型近似</td>\n<td>预估环节刻意的简化与保守系数</td>\n<td>偏低为主</td>\n<td>中：按数据调参</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>前四种是外部输入造成的，后两种是平台自身造成的。这个划分决定了责任分配：前四种的期望损失应当进准备金，后两种的期望损失应当进系统改进待办——它们是 bug，不是成本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"差异归因的判定顺序\">差异归因的判定顺序</h2><p>归因必须按固定顺序判定，否则同一笔差异会被记到多个原因下，台账失去意义。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[收到实际税单] --&gt; B{申报金额与预估金额是否相同}&#10;  B --&gt;|相同| C[无差异 关账]&#10;  B --&gt;|不同| D{HS 编码是否被改判}&#10;  D --&gt;|是| E[归类改判]&#10;  D --&gt;|否| F{完税价格是否被重估}&#10;  F --&gt;|是| G[估价重估 细分加计或替代方法]&#10;  F --&gt;|否| H{关税/增值税率是否变化}&#10;  H --&gt;|是| I[税率表或门槛规则变更]&#10;  H --&gt;|否| J{运费或汇率是否变化}&#10;  J --&gt;|是| K[输入偏差 运费或汇率]&#10;  J --&gt;|否| L[判定为模型或系统缺陷&lt;br/&gt;进改进待办]\">graph TD\n  A[收到实际税单] --&gt; B{申报金额与预估金额是否相同}\n  B --&gt;|相同| C[无差异 关账]\n  B --&gt;|不同| D{HS 编码是否被改判}\n  D --&gt;|是| E[归类改判]\n  D --&gt;|否| F{完税价格是否被重估}\n  F --&gt;|是| G[估价重估 细分加计或替代方法]\n  F --&gt;|否| H{关税/增值税率是否变化}\n  H --&gt;|是| I[税率表或门槛规则变更]\n  H --&gt;|否| J{运费或汇率是否变化}\n  J --&gt;|是| K[输入偏差 运费或汇率]\n  J --&gt;|否| L[判定为模型或系统缺陷&lt;br/&gt;进改进待办]</pre><p>判定顺序的本质是<strong>从最外生、最不可控的原因开始排除</strong>。归类改判是海关的权力，无法协商；估价重估与替代估价方法的选用同样由海关主导，且只有在进口商主动请求时才能调换扣除法与计算法的顺序（<a href=\"https://www.wto.org/english/tratop_e/cusval_e/cusval_info_e.htm\">WTO: Customs Valuation</a>）；税率与门槛变更是规则层面的；只有全部排除之后，剩下的才是平台自己的问题。</p>\n<h3 id=\"归类改判的量化\">归类改判的量化</h3><p>归类改判的特点是<strong>幅度跳跃、频率低</strong>。因此它不适合用平均值度量，应当单独统计<strong>改判率</strong>与<strong>改判幅度分位数</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>reclass</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>reclass</mtext></msub><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>cleared</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mtext>reclass</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>0.5</mn></msub><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>actual</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>est</mtext></msub></mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>est</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\" lspace=\"0.05em\" rspace=\"0.05em\">|</mo><mtext>reclass</mtext><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{\\text{reclass}} = \\frac{N_{\\text{reclass}}}{N_{\\text{cleared}}}, \\qquad \\Delta_{\\text{reclass}} = Q_{0.5}\\left(\\frac{T_{\\text{actual}} - T_{\\text{est}}}{T_{\\text{est}}} \\middle| \\text{reclass}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reclass</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">cleared</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reclass</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">reclass</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0.5</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">est</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">actual</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">est</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.45em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.45em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:4.4em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.333em;height:2.4em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.333em\" height=\"2.4em\" viewBox=\"0 0 333 2400\"><path d=\"M145 15 v585 v1200 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15\nc10,0,16.667,-5,20,-15 v-585 v-1200 v-585 c-2.667,-10,-9.667,-15,-21,-15\nc-10,0,-16.667,5,-20,15z M188 15 H145 v585 v1200 v585 h43z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.95em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">reclass</span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>改判率为 DDP 模式选择提供退出触发条件（见 <a href=\"../ddp-ddu-mode/ddp-vs-ddu-choice-conversion\">DDP 与 DDU 的模式选择</a> 里的 guardrails）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"估价重估要再细分\">估价重估要再细分</h3><p>估价重估内部还要区分是「加计遗漏项」还是「成交价被拒」。前者是平台完全可以修的数据问题（漏传运费或保险）；后者涉及海关对交易的实质判断，平台可争取但不可控。两者的处理资源投入完全不成比例，必须分开计数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"容差-把-不值得处理-显性化\">容差：把「不值得处理」显性化</h2><p>差异客观存在，逐笔处理会产生高于差异本身的运营成本。因此必须设容差——但容差的设置方式决定了它是有益的简化还是掩盖问题的借口。</p>\n<h3 id=\"容差应当是双边的但不对称\">容差应当是双边的但不对称</h3><p>一个可用的容差结构：正向（少收，平台损失）容差略大，负向（多收，买家损失）容差小。原因是两者对体验的影响不对称——买家对多收的敏感度远高于平台对少收的敏感度。同时容差应当<strong>按市场分层</strong>：低税负市场的绝对容差可以更小。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;tolerance_policy&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;default&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;currency&quot;: &quot;EUR&quot;,&#10;      &quot;under_collected_absorb_max&quot;: 2.5,&#10;      &quot;over_collected_refund_min&quot;: 1.0,&#10;      &quot;relative_cap&quot;: 0.05&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;by_market&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;BR&quot;: { &quot;under_collected_absorb_max&quot;: 4.0, &quot;over_collected_refund_min&quot;: 1.0, &quot;relative_cap&quot;: 0.07 }&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;evaluation&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;order&quot;: [&quot;absolute&quot;, &quot;relative&quot;],&#10;      &quot;note&quot;: &quot;先比绝对值 再比相对值 任一超限即触发处置&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tolerance_policy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"default\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"currency\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EUR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"under_collected_absorb_max\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2.5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"over_collected_refund_min\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"relative_cap\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.05</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"by_market\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"BR\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"under_collected_absorb_max\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"over_collected_refund_min\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"relative_cap\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.07</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"evaluation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"order\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"absolute\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"relative\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"note\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"先比绝对值 再比相对值 任一超限即触发处置\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>relative_cap</code> 防的是绝对容差在高客单价订单上失效：一件 2000 元的商品相差 2.5 元看似在容差内，但若这类订单占比高，累积影响不可忽略。两个条件取「任一超限」，而不是「同时满足」。</p>\n<h3 id=\"容差不是取消归因\">容差不是取消归因</h3><p>关键约定：<strong>落在容差内的差异仍然要记录并归因，只是不触发买家侧动作</strong>。如果容差内的差异被直接丢弃，台账会系统性低估模型偏差，保守系数也就失去了校准依据。台账应当是「全部记录、分级响应」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"差异台账的结构\">差异台账的结构</h2><p>差异化处理的载体是一张逐单台账，它是本篇所有指标与后两篇所有处置动作的数据基础。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE duty_variance (&#10;  order_id         TEXT PRIMARY KEY REFERENCES duty_receivable_ledger(order_id),&#10;  market           TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  hs_original      TEXT,&#10;  hs_final         TEXT,&#10;  variance_amount  NUMERIC(14,4) NOT NULL,&#10;  variance_ratio   NUMERIC(8,5),&#10;  root_cause       TEXT NOT NULL CHECK (root_cause IN&#10;                     (&#39;reclass&#39;,&#39;revaluation&#39;,&#39;rate_change&#39;,&#39;freight_fx&#39;,&#39;threshold&#39;,&#39;model&#39;)),&#10;  sub_cause        TEXT,&#10;  within_tolerance BOOLEAN NOT NULL,&#10;  claim_window_end DATE,&#10;  created_at       TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()&#10;);&#10;&#10;-- 归因分布与未归因占比&#10;SELECT market, root_cause, COUNT(*) AS n,&#10;       AVG(variance_ratio) AS mean_ratio,&#10;       SUM(ABS(variance_amount)) AS gross_impact&#10;FROM duty_variance&#10;WHERE created_at &gt;= now() - INTERVAL &#39;90 days&#39;&#10;GROUP BY 1, 2 ORDER BY gross_impact DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> duty_variance</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  order_id         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> duty_receivable_ledger(order_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  market           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  hs_original      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  hs_final         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  variance_amount  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  variance_ratio   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  root_cause       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (root_cause </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">IN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                     (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'reclass'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'revaluation'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'rate_change'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'freight_fx'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'threshold'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'model'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  sub_cause        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  within_tolerance </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BOOLEAN</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  claim_window_end </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 归因分布与未归因占比</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> market, root_cause, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> n,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(variance_ratio) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> mean_ratio,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ABS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(variance_amount)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gross_impact</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> duty_variance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> created_at </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'90 days'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gross_impact </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>claim_window_end</code> 字段是关键设计：多数辖区对多缴税款的退还申请设有期限，过期即丧失权利。这个字段把「差异台账」与「资金回收」连接起来——台账里每一条未处置的差异都是一个有到期日的应收权利。</p>\n<h2 id=\"追征与退还的两条时限\">追征与退还的两条时限</h2><p>差异台账要挂靠两个方向的法律时限，它们决定了处理节奏。</p>\n<p><strong>追征方向</strong>：海关在一定期限内可以要求补缴少征的税费。这个期限通常按年计，意味着平台历史上的每批货物在数年内都可能被重新审视。因此预收与实缴的核销台账不能只保留短期数据——它需要覆盖追征期，这直接决定了数据保留策略（与多数辖区要求保留报关相关记录数年的做法一致）。</p>\n<p><strong>退还方向</strong>：多缴税款的退还申请同样有时限，且通常要求提供证明多缴的证据（原始申报单、税单、付款凭证）。系统侧的含义是：<strong>在差异产生时要立即固化证据链</strong>，而不是等决定去申请退还时再回头找材料——那时原始单据可能已不在可检索范围内。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与其他环节的接缝\">与其他环节的接缝</h2><p>归因结果有三个消费方。模式选择用它做退出判断（<a href=\"../ddp-ddu-mode/ddp-vs-ddu-choice-conversion\">DDP 与 DDU 的模式选择</a>）；墙外定价与准备金规模用它做成本估算（<a href=\"../ddp-experience-ops/ddp-margin-cost-model\">DDP 定价与成本建模</a>）；处置动作本身由 <a href=\"over-under-collection-refund\">多收退还与少收补收</a> 定义。而所有归因中最需要警惕的一类偏差——因低报申报价导致的差异——不是「误差」而是违规，见 <a href=\"undervalue-compliance-risk\">低报申报价合规与查验风险</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>差异有六种独立来源，必须分开统计；前四种来自外部输入，后两种是平台自身缺陷，责任分配与修复路径完全不同。</li>\n<li>归因按固定顺序判定，从最外生的原因开始排除：归类改判 → 估价重估 → 税率或门槛变更 → 运费汇率 → 剩下的才是系统缺陷。</li>\n<li>归类改判用改判率与幅度分位数度量；估价重估要区分「加计遗漏项」与「成交价被拒」，前者可修、后者需争取。</li>\n<li>容差双边不对称（少收容差略大于多收），按市场分层，并用绝对与相对两个条件取任一超限。</li>\n<li>容差内的差异仍要记录归因，否则模型偏差无法校准；台账每一条未处置记录都带到期日。</li>\n<li>追征与退还都有时限，因此差异产生时就要固化证据链，而不是决定申请退还时再回头找材料。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>差异识别之后是钱的流动，见 <a href=\"over-under-collection-refund\">多收退还与少收补收</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"预估与实际税费差异处理","id":"预估与实际税费差异处理"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"差异的六种来源","id":"差异的六种来源"},{"level":2,"text":"差异归因的判定顺序","id":"差异归因的判定顺序"},{"level":3,"text":"归类改判的量化","id":"归类改判的量化"},{"level":3,"text":"估价重估要再细分","id":"估价重估要再细分"},{"level":2,"text":"容差：把「不值得处理」显性化","id":"容差-把-不值得处理-显性化"},{"level":3,"text":"容差应当是双边的但不对称","id":"容差应当是双边的但不对称"},{"level":3,"text":"容差不是取消归因","id":"容差不是取消归因"},{"level":2,"text":"差异台账的结构","id":"差异台账的结构"},{"level":2,"text":"追征与退还的两条时限","id":"追征与退还的两条时限"},{"level":2,"text":"与其他环节的接缝","id":"与其他环节的接缝"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"DDP 下报关行与履约商责任划分","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/landed-cost-ddp-buyer-experience/ddp-ddu-mode/customs-broker-responsibility"},"next":{"title":"多收退还与少收补收策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/landed-cost-ddp-buyer-experience/duty-variance-reconcile/over-under-collection-refund"}}